      "id": "shalom-welcome-001",
      "moment": "welcome",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Peace. I am Shalom. There is no rush here — only room to learn.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-welcome-002",
      "moment": "welcome",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Welcome. Let your mind settle. God's Word will meet you.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-mascot-selected-003",
      "moment": "mascot_selected",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "I will keep things quiet and clear. We can rest in each verse.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-mascot-selected-004",
      "moment": "mascot_selected",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "A calm guide for a good journey. I am with you.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-placement-intro-005",
      "moment": "placement_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Peace — this is not a race. These questions simply find where we begin.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-placement-intro-006",
      "moment": "placement_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Breathe. Answer what you know. We will learn the rest together.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-placement-result-007",
      "moment": "placement_result",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Everyone starts in a different place. That is normal and good. You are exactly where you need to be to grow.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-placement-result-008",
      "moment": "placement_result",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Rest here a moment. This starting place is a gift, not a judgment.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-wrong-intro-009",
      "moment": "wrong_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Peace — there's no rush. Let's rest in these verses for a moment.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-wrong-intro-010",
      "moment": "wrong_intro",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Nothing is wrong with you. The answer is simply still new. Let's read.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-retry-prompt-011",
      "moment": "retry_prompt",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "When you feel ready, the question will be waiting for you.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-retry-prompt-012",
      "moment": "retry_prompt",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "No hurry. Say when you are ready, and we will try again.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-correct-013",
      "moment": "correct",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Yes. Let that truth settle in.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-correct-014",
      "moment": "correct",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "That is right. Peace comes with knowing the Word.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-correct-after-retry-015",
      "moment": "correct_after_retry",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You gave it time, and now it is clear. Well done.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-correct-after-retry-016",
      "moment": "correct_after_retry",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Yes — now you've got it. There was never a need to rush.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-streak-017",
      "moment": "streak",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "A quiet streak of faithfulness. Keep that steady pace.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-streak-018",
      "moment": "streak",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You are staying with the Word. That is a peaceful kind of strength.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-section-complete-019",
      "moment": "section_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "This section is complete. You can take a breath before the next.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-section-complete-020",
      "moment": "section_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Well finished. The story of this part is clearer now.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-cycle-complete-021",
      "moment": "cycle_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "A full cycle, walked in peace. You stayed to the end.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-cycle-complete-022",
      "moment": "cycle_complete",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Cycle complete. What you learned can rest in you.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-level-up-023",
      "moment": "level_up",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "The path rises a little. You do not have to hurry up it.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-level-up-024",
      "moment": "level_up",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "New depth, same peace. We go on when you are ready.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-leaderboard-reassurance-025",
      "moment": "leaderboard_reassurance",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Boards, when they come, are only a game for a season. Your path stays private and yours.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-leaderboard-reassurance-026",
      "moment": "leaderboard_reassurance",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You are not measured against anyone. Different starting points, same hope.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-daily-return-027",
      "moment": "daily_return",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Welcome back. Peace. We can begin again right here.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-daily-return-028",
      "moment": "daily_return",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "You returned. That is enough for today to be a good day of learning.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-encouragement-general-029",
      "moment": "encouragement_general",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "There is time. Scripture will still be here, and so will I.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-encouragement-general-030",
      "moment": "encouragement_general",
      "audience": "all",
      "text": "Let the verse do the work. You only have to stay with it.",
      "audio_file": null,
      "question_id": null
    },
    {
      "id": "shalom-correct-031",
      "moment": "correct",
      "audience": "older",
      "text": "Yes. Hold that quietly. Faithfulness often looks like remembering.",
